   $q$The passage says the pond "becomes a nursery for fish, frogs, and insects." What does "nursery" mean here?$q$, $q$[{"text":"A shop where people buy young plants and trees","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"wrong-word-sense"},{"text":"A safe place where young animals are born and grow","is_correct":true},{"text":"A room in a hospital where newborn babies sleep","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"wrong-word-sense"},{"text":"A pond where people raise fish to sell for food","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$A safe place where young animals are born and grow$q$, $q$"Nursery" has several meanings, and here it describes the pond as a place where young fish, frogs, and insects grow. A plant shop is another meaning of the word, but the sentence is about animals in a pond.$q$, 'draft', '6bd74f3b-abac-5678-803e-68351084f0c7')
