   $q$The robot's cardboard arm "drooped like a wilted flower." What does this simile show about the arm?$q$, $q$[{"text":"It hung down limply because it was too weak to hold itself up.","is_correct":true},{"text":"It was painted with bright colors like a flower in a garden.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"wrong-comparison-point"},{"text":"It was made from leaves and stems instead of cardboard.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"literal-reading"},{"text":"It slowly grew longer and stronger as the test went on.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"reversed-meaning"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$It hung down limply because it was too weak to hold itself up.$q$, $q$A wilted flower sags because it cannot stand up, so the simile shows the arm sagging. The comparison is about drooping, not color, and the passage says the arm was cardboard.$q$, 'draft', '2d7f08c4-8dab-54c2-871c-7a3e1b97b79f')
