   $q$Ms. Okonkwo tells Rohan, "A mind like yours deserves a paper trail." What does she mean?$q$, $q$[{"text":"He should be watched closely because he may have broken a rule.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"wrong-idiom-sense"},{"text":"His strong ideas should be written down and backed up with notes.","is_correct":true},{"text":"He talks so much that his words should fill a whole notebook.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-tone"},{"text":"He should walk along a path of paper to find his way to class.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"literal-reading"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$His strong ideas should be written down and backed up with notes.$q$, $q$She just said "bring the notes too," so she means his good thinking deserves written records to support it. A "paper trail" can mean evidence of wrongdoing, but she is praising his mind, not accusing him.$q$, 'draft', 'f94e5168-e149-5020-a7a6-b2ff9676ff2b')
